{"html":"<div>\n<h2 id=\"basic-introduction-of-lightburn\"> Basic Introduction of LightBurn</h2>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><span><strong>LightBurn is layout, editing, and control software for your laser cutter.</strong></span></p>\n  <p>LightBurn is a native application written for Windows and Mac OS. No subscription needed.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/software/%E8%81%94%E6%83%B3%E6%88%AA%E5%9B%BE_20251013152140.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"LightBurn\">\n  <figcaption>Cr.https://lightburnsoftware.com/</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"download-and-install-lightburn\"> Download and Install LightBurn</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://lightburnsoftware.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download Link</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"lightburn-user-manual\"> LightBurn User Manual</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/lightburn-software-introduction\">LightBurn Introduction</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://docs.lightburnsoftware.com/latest/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Docs</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://lightburnsoftware.com/pages/tutorials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tutorials</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://forum.lightburnsoftware.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Support Forum</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"instruction\"> Instruction</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/export-files-from-machine-memory\">How to export files from machine memory back to PC</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/lightburn/camera-calibration-guide\">Camera Calibration Guide</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"troubleshooting\"> Troubleshooting</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/lightburn-camera-calibration-issues-black-blank-or-garbled-screen\">LightBurn 2.0 camera calibration issues: black, blank or garbled screen</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/usb-connection-failure-unknown-driver-error-on-pc\">USB connection failure: unknown driver error on PC</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/machine-always-cuts-first-regardless-of-layer-order\">Machine always cuts first, regardless of layer order</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/squares-drawn-on-canvas-are-processed-as-rectangles\">Squares drawn on canvas are processed as rectangles</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/lightburn-cannot-utilize-cameras-maximum-resolution\">Low camera accuracy (unable to reach maximum resolution)</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/engraved-text-hollow-or-broken-lines\">Engraved text with hollow centers or broken lines</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/fix-laser-dimension-accuracy\">Drawing dimensions do not match actual dimensions</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/camera-overlay-offset-fix\">The processing result and the camera overlay are offset</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/laser-head-not-returning-origin\">Laser head fails to return to origin after job completion</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/delete-saved-design-files\">How to delete saved design files from the device</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/lightburn-2-1-device-camera-errors\">Device Info Loss &amp; Camera Errors After Upgrading to LightBurn 2.1.0</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/laser-head-collision-cross-hatch-engraving\">Laser Head Collisions and Errors with Cross-Hatch Engraving Enabled</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/lightburn/position-offset-during-unidirectional-engraving-or-cutting\">Position Offset During Unidirectional Engraving / Cutting</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"basic-introduction-of-makerboost\"> Basic Introduction of MakerBoost</h2>\n<figure><img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/software/makerboost_start.png\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n<h3 id=\"download-and-install-makerboost\"> Download and Install MakerBoost</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>If you need to use the beta version of MakerBoost, please <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wDhvQ1M-pfBUKISFbSZ4h0pxcE7S331H?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">click here</a> to download it.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"how-to-connect-the-device-to-makerboost\"> How to Connect the Device to MakerBoost</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/quick-start-makerboost\">Quick Start</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"makerboost-user-manual\"> MakerBoost User Manual</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>MakerBoost Introduction</li>\n  <li>Docs</li>\n  <li>Tutorials</li>\n  <li>Support Forum</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"instruction-1\"> Instruction</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>How to export files from machine memory back to PC</li>\n  <li><a href=\"#/wiki/software-app/makerboost/camera-calibration-guide\">Camera Calibration Guide</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"troubleshooting-1\"> Troubleshooting</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li> </li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>","toc":[{"id":"basic-introduction-of-lightburn","level":2,"text":"Basic Introduction of LightBurn"},{"id":"download-and-install-lightburn","level":3,"text":"Download and Install LightBurn"},{"id":"lightburn-user-manual","level":3,"text":"LightBurn User Manual"},{"id":"instruction","level":3,"text":"Instruction"},{"id":"troubleshooting","level":3,"text":"Troubleshooting"},{"id":"basic-introduction-of-makerboost","level":2,"text":"Basic Introduction of MakerBoost"},{"id":"download-and-install-makerboost","level":3,"text":"Download and Install MakerBoost"},{"id":"how-to-connect-the-device-to-makerboost","level":3,"text":"How to Connect the Device to MakerBoost"},{"id":"makerboost-user-manual","level":3,"text":"MakerBoost User Manual"},{"id":"instruction-1","level":3,"text":"Instruction"},{"id":"troubleshooting-1","level":3,"text":"Troubleshooting"}]}